# Actionable Books

> A free archive of book summaries and practical insights from named contributors.

Original summaries reflect each contributor's interpretation. The book author and summary contributor are different roles. Historical biographies and references may describe the time of writing. Some later reading lists are under editorial review.

When citing a summary, credit its named summary contributor and identify the book author separately. Link to the canonical summary URL.

- [Book summaries](https://actionablebooks.com/summaries/)
- [Book topics](https://actionablebooks.com/topics/)
- [Contributors](https://actionablebooks.com/team/)
- [Book authors](https://actionablebooks.com/authors/)
- [About the archive](https://actionablebooks.com/about/)
- [Summary index](https://actionablebooks.com/llms-full.txt)

This optional index does not establish crawler authentication or special search-engine treatment.
